WEZTERM CHEATSHEET

USAGE: wezterm [command] [options]
       Leader: Ctrl+a
       Modifier (Alt): ALT

APPLICATION CONTROL:
  ALT+p                       Command palette
  LEADER+h                    Show cheatsheets
  LEADER+SHIFT+d              Debug overlay
  ALT+/                       Search current content
  ALT+q                       Quit Wezterm

FONT & DISPLAY:
  ALT+=                       Increase font size
  ALT+-                       Decrease font size
  ALT+0                       Reset font size

WORKSPACE MANAGEMENT:
  LEADER+e                    Switch workspace (smart)
  LEADER+p                    Project selector
  LEADER+m                    Switch to most recent workspace
  LEADER+r                    Rename current workspace

SESSION RESURRECTION (PLUGIN):
  LEADER+s                    Save session (workspace & window)
  LEADER+l                    Load session (fuzzy find)

TAB MANAGEMENT:
  ALT+SHIFT+n                 New tab
  ALT+SHIFT+w                 Close current tab
  ALT+1-9                     Jump to tab by number
  LEADER+t                    Tab selector (fuzzy search)

PANE MANAGEMENT:
  Split:
  ALT+s                       Split vertically (top/bottom)
  ALT+n                       Split horizontally (left/right)
  LEADER+z                    Toggle pane zoom

  Navigation (Smart Splits):
  CTRL+h/j/k/l                Navigate panes by direction

  Resizing (Smart Splits):
  ALT+h/j/k/l                 Resize panes by direction

MODAL OPERATIONS:
  Copy Mode (Leader+y):
  b                           Copy entire buffer
  p                           Copy current page
  l                           Smart line copy
  r                           Regex copy (IPs, emails, URLs, etc)

  Open Mode (Leader+o):
  c                           Open VS Code in current directory
  u                           Open URL from screen

  Muxer Mode (Leader+m):
  a                           Attach to unix domain
  d                           Detach from unix domain
  SHIFT+$                     Rename session

COPY & PASTE:
  ALT+c                       Copy selected text
  ALT+v                       Paste clipboard content
  LEADER+v                    Enter vim-style copy mode

SCROLLING (VIM-STYLE):
  ALT+u                       Scroll up half page
  ALT+d                       Scroll down half page
  ALT+b                       Scroll up full page
  ALT+f                       Scroll down full page
  ALT+g                       Scroll to top
  ALT+SHIFT+g                 Scroll to bottom

CONFIGURATION:
  Config location:            ~/.config/wezterm/
  Launch items:               config/launch.lua
  Workspaces:                 utils/workspaces.lua
  Cheatsheets:                ~/.config/wezterm/cheatsheets/
